obj_id: agentGenerated_MonthlySalesPerformanceByRegion-80791b9b
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Monthly Sales Performance By Region
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 09cf1467-3e78-4962-8a56-22dc2af085c3
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Seasonal peaks drive highest performance with November 2024 reaching $118,448 and December 2023 at $97,000
        • General upward trend over 48-month period from February 2021 baseline of $4,520
        • February consistently shows weakest performance across multiple years (2021: $4,520, 2022: $11,951)

        Recommendations:
        • Capitalize on Q4 momentum by increasing inventory and marketing spend during October-December peak season
        • Address February sales gaps with targeted promotions or new product launches during slow periods
